# The client app has no build-time env vars: the browser always calls same-origin /api.
# Server-side only (read at runtime by `npm run dev` and `npm start`, never inlined into the bundle):
# where /api/* and the SSR session check go.
API_UPSTREAM=http://localhost:3000
# Absolute origin for canonical / hreflang / og:url tags. Unset = the request's origin (fine for dev).
# PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://app.<your-domain>
# X-Forwarded-For on proxied calls: append (default) adds the peer address; pass (Fly.io, behind an edge
# that already appends the visitor) forwards it unchanged. See docs/project-documentation/deploy.md.
# FORWARDED_FOR_MODE=append
